nQ&_nc_ss=79689&oh=00_AQOIvvI0cSMI4ZY4Om9Y_6_zD2TjwEDclS_pTAOB4sY67g&oe=6AE60CC3", "width": 436, "height": 776, "id": "9", "resolution": "436x776"}], "comments": [{"author": "sovereigntriumvir", "author_id": "40832424145", "id": "18116157275027026", "text": "This looks fun and adorable. Definitely adding this to the wishlist", "timestamp": 1792898222, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "sovereigntriumvir", "author_id": "40832424145", "id": "17869889097660336", "text": "This looks fun and adorable. Definitely adding this to the wishlist", "timestamp": 1792895504, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "sovereigntriumvir", "author_id": "40832424145", "id": "17954057760328341", "text": "This looks fun and adorable. Definitely adding this to the wishlist", "timestamp": 1792895431, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "campuz_99", "author_id": "29458657334", "id": "17905558701355621", "text": "Bro, there isn't a similar game called tinny towns? I mean is a game that i played in itch io, maybe you would want to look it so it could maybe give you some ideas", "timestamp": 1792530345, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "overallbook", "author_id": "260618636", "id": "18164177479496879", "text": "Haha holy shit, I guessed what it was going to be (not the specific term) because I use fantasy grounds, and there's a map layer that does this exact thing for stuff like water and fire\ud83d\ude02", "timestamp": 1792160058, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "afrobrian", "author_id": "3246666929", "id": "18108393194183832", "text": "This might be an intimate question. But with the views you gained on this video, did you manage to accumulate a satisfying amout of wishlists  please share\ud83d\ude4f some insight to a fellow developer", "timestamp": 1792048546, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "ntsahaskezi", "author_id": "10729904787", "id": "18168197788476901", "text": "Noise textures are amazing. They're used a lot in Houdini as well for simulations.", "timestamp": 1792039735, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "dirtyratwizard", "author_id": "261323483", "id": "18032696963852443", "text": "Can\u2019t wait!!!!", "timestamp": 1792016293, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "patrick_._starfish", "author_id": "1619680705", "id": "18345993313283907", "text": "Are you running the noise in world space in the horizontal plane or in screen-space with the isometric projection so it looks in world space?", "timestamp": 1792014972, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "bossblobgames", "author_id": "47092335175", "id": "18123356062898848", "text": "@lanedefensegame Sorta... there are townsfolk you draft which have synergies- They give you extra bonuses for certain decisions which helps you shape your town!", "timestamp": 1791932140, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "lanedefensegame", "author_id": "23815952767", "id": "18128140411884578", "text": "The living-landscape idea makes the tile combinations feel like they\u2019re building a place, not just chasing a score. Do tiles have set synergies players can plan around, or is discovery meant to happen more organically?", "timestamp": 1791621485, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "nguyenduy_bh", "author_id": "49649934188", "id": "17921778927222089", "text": "Poronoid~", "timestamp": 1791479121, "like_count": 2}, {"author": "iamgodzillaandyourejapan", "author_id": "2263370152", "id": "18211860523361725", "text": "the animation path is amazing tho, it's so insanely cool and juicy when devs decide \"yeah, every little thingy is going to have an animation\"", "timestamp": 1791445404, "like_count": 8}, {"author": "pit21_programmer", "author_id": "23550924648", "id": "17988424113077536", "text": "What?! That is so cool, I noted that down!", "timestamp": 1791414618, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "lovelycraft_mythos", "author_id": "39701087519", "id": "18098423177543860", "text": "Nice tip! \ud83e\udd1f\ud83d\udd25\ud83e\udd1f", "timestamp": 1791409100, "like_count": 0}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DeKlghCOQiC/", "original_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DeKlghCO